    "name": "Project / Business Appraisal Report for SME Credit Facility",
    "issuer": "People's Bank, Sri Lanka",
    "annexure": "Annexure I-V",
    "note": "Every criterion carries a 'ref' citing the clause of the source form it derives from. Traceability is a thesis requirement: no criterion exists without a source clause."
  },
  "weightStatus": {
    "state": "PLACEHOLDER",
    "detail": "All weights are provisional equal-splits within each level. They MUST be replaced by elicited values before any result is reported. Do not publish figures computed from placeholder weights.",
    "plannedMethod": "Best-Worst Method (Rezaei 2015; linear model Rezaei 2016), consistency ratio reported per respondent, responses above CR 0.25 excluded, aggregation by geometric mean. BWM was chosen over pairwise AHP because AHP over this tree requires 168 comparisons per respondent against BWM's 86; the fatigue-driven inconsistency at that length would make the weights unusable."
  },
